==Trivia==
*Niconico TV is based on the Japanese video-sharing service [[:wikipedia:Niconico|Niconico]]. It gets its name and design from the logo of Niconico featuring a TV.
*The text that scrolls by before its attack, ''くるぞ...'' means ''Here it comes...''

